      "# Cloudflare Workers _redirects apply before asset serving. Keep custom\n# rules exact; Cloudflare SPA mode owns app-route fallback through /index.html.\n# @samebase/app-prerender-redirects:start\n# Generated by pnpm run generate:cloudflare-redirects.\n# Cloudflare SPA mode serves /index.html for unknown app routes, so\n# the SPA shell owns that file. These exact aliases expose prerendered\n# public pages without catching hashed assets.\n\n/ /_landing.html 200\n\n/about /about/index.html 200\n/about/ /about/index.html 200\n/about/index.html /about/index.html 200\n# @samebase/app-prerender-redirects:end\n",
